    Call the privileged helper Helper in Launchpad's Chinese strings
    
    The Chinese translation rendered the helper as 辅助工具 ("auxiliary
    tool"), which reads as a generic utility rather than the one component
    the rest of the UI and the docs call Helper. It is a proper name, so the
    eleven strings that mention it now keep it: "特权 Helper", "Helper 没有
    响应。", "无法安装 Helper" and so on.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

